          "id": 2083084700,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Did you see these warnings in the pipeline about value_strings?  The 2nd will be hidden in each case..\n\nExamining:\nepan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c \n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  50 repeated with different values - was \"InvitorName\" now \"Net2PhoneCallLen\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  51 repeated with different values - was \"InviteeName\" now \"AdSpaceId\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  52 repeated with different values - was \"InvitedUser\" now \"UsesIMIPClient\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  53 repeated with different values - was \"JoinedUser\" now \"Shortcut\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  54 repeated with different values - was \"DeclinedUser\" now \"FeedVer\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  60 repeated with different values - was \"DeviceType\" now \"UserType\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  61 repeated with different values - was \"WebcamToken\" now \"TimedP2PConnFlg\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  70 repeated with different values - was \"ConverseCommand\" now \"SmsPhone\"\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-ymsg.c : value_string ymsg_field_vals - value  90 repeated with different values - was \"HasMail\" now \"ConverseCmdDecText\"",
