      "title": "YMSG: Update same value fields' string values",
      "message": "YMSG: Update same value fields' string values\n\nDepending on the context, some field values are reused to represent completely different things.\nIn the Y!M binaries their string values are concatenated with the pipe character (`|`).\n",
